# Post-commit hook — reports what is still uncommitted.
#
# Runs only after a commit succeeded, so by construction it cannot
# discourage committing; it just answers "what's left?" at the one moment
# you are already thinking about it.
#
# Always exits 0. A reporting hook must never be able to fail a commit
# that has already been written.

sh scripts/wip-report.sh >/dev/null || true
